{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMIDI"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Reading messy files"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Use lenient parsing to recover from common real-world SMF deviations, inspect what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was repaired, and re-export a clean file."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Real-world MIDI files frequently deviate from the RP-001 specification — truncated chunk"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lengths, missing End-of-Track markers, extra bytes after the last event, or track-count"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mismatches in the header are all common. Strict parsing (the default) throws on any such"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviation; lenient parsing repairs what it can and reports what it found."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Parse in lenient mode","anchor":"Parse-in-lenient-mode"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a parser with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFParser\/Strictness\/lenient","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFParser\/parseWithDiagnostics(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFParser\/parse(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import IvorMIDI","","let data = try Data(contentsOf: fileURL)","let parser = SMFParser(strictness: .lenient)","","let (sequence, diagnostics) = try parser.parseWithDiagnostics(data)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the file is beyond recovery (for example, the header chunk is completely absent or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"format byte is invalid) "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"parseWithDiagnostics(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" still throws a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFParseError"},{"type":"text","text":". Lenient"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode only handles deviations it can repair without losing data."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Inspect the diagnostics","anchor":"Inspect-the-diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFDiagnostic","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" value describes one repair the parser made. Log them or present them to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["if diagnostics.isEmpty {","    print(\"File is clean\")","} else {","    print(\"Repaired \\(diagnostics.count) issue(s):\")","    for diagnostic in diagnostics {","        print(\"  • \\(diagnostic.message)\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The possible diagnostics are:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Case"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Meaning","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFDiagnostic\/chunkLengthClamped(declared:available:)","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A chunk’s declared length exceeded the remaining data; clamped to what was available.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFDiagnostic\/missingEndOfTrack(trackIndex:)","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A track had no End-of-Track meta-event.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFDiagnostic\/strayRealTimeByteSkipped","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A system real-time byte (0xF8–0xFE) appeared in the event stream and was discarded."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFDiagnostic\/trackCountMismatch(declared:actual:)","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The header’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ntrks"},{"type":"text","text":" field did not match the number of MTrk chunks found."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFDiagnostic\/trackFormatCoerced(from:to:)","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A format-0 file contained multiple tracks and was reinterpreted as format 1.","type":"text"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"text":"Validate the repaired sequence","anchor":"Validate-the-repaired-sequence","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Even after successful lenient parsing the resulting "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" may have higher-level"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issues. Run "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFSequence\/validate()"},{"type":"text","text":" to find them:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let issues = sequence.validate()","","let errors = issues.filter { $0.severity == .error }","let warnings = issues.filter { $0.severity == .warning }","","if !errors.isEmpty {","    print(\"\\(errors.count) error(s) — formatting will fail:\")","    for issue in errors { print(\"  ✕ \\(issue.message)\") }","}","","if !warnings.isEmpty {","    print(\"\\(warnings.count) warning(s) — interoperability may be affected:\")","    for issue in warnings { print(\"  ⚠ \\(issue.message)\") }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error-severity issues ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFValidationIssue\/eventAfterEndOfTrack(trackIndex:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFValidationIssue\/missingEndOfTrack(trackIndex:)"},{"type":"text","text":") mean that "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFFormatter"},{"type":"text","text":" will throw if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you try to re-export as-is. Warning-severity issues (tempo or time-signature events in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wrong track, sequence number not at time zero) are spec violations that may cause playback"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"problems but do not prevent formatting."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Re-export a clean file","anchor":"Re-export-a-clean-file"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFFormatter"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically appends a missing End-of-Track event to any track that lacks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, so a sequence with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFDiagnostic\/missingEndOfTrack(trackIndex:)"},{"type":"text","text":" diagnostics can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-exported cleanly without manual repair. A sequence with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFValidationIssue\/eventAfterEndOfTrack(trackIndex:)"},{"type":"text","text":" errors requires manual intervention"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before formatting:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Only re-export if there are no error-severity issues","guard issues.filter({ $0.severity == .error }).isEmpty else {","    print(\"Cannot reformat: sequence has error-severity issues\")","    return","}","","let cleanData = try SMFFormatter().format(sequence)","try cleanData.write(to: outputURL)"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormidi\/readingmessyfiles"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/ReadingMessyFiles","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://IvorMIDI/documentation/IvorMIDI/SMFParser":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFParser","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi\/smfparser","kind":"symbol","title":"SMFParser","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SMFParser","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A parser that decodes raw binary data into an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFSequence"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SMFParser","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorMIDI/documentation/IvorMIDI/SMFParser/parse(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/SMFParser\/parse(_:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Parses the provided data and returns the decoded SMF sequence."}]